  m_Name: Karen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DollConfig
  dollName: Karen
  dollOwner: Cyan Stewart, 10 y.o., female, deceased
  dollStory: Karen is a bride doll given to Cyan at the age of 9. Unlike typical
    imaginary conversations children have with their toys, Cyan would engage in responsive
    dialogues with Karen. Not only would Karen 'reply' to Cyan, but she would also
    occasionally tell Cyan what to do. At one point, Karen reportedly asked Cyan
    to play on their apartment's balcony. While playing dangerously close to the
    edge, Cyan fell eight stories down.
  dollReason: Karen harbors a spirit that lacks any means of physical contact. It
    appears to be a weak spirit trapped inside the doll. Cyan's death does not correspond
    with the doll's actions, as the doll is incapable of causing harm or communicating
    with anyone. It seems that Cyan's death was simply a tragic accident. However,
    the doll is considered dangerous due to the spirit it harbors, which requires
    further investigation.
